  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "4 cups shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "milk, as needed",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground red pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line baking sheets with parchment paper or lightly grease them.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/63eoQ4etlSOKvHpCHB1BNirFhlQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22857-cheese-straws-VAT-step-01-0d9e3c2155bb43ff90eb375835229da4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22857/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and Cheddar cheese together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until creamy and well blended. Add flour and salt; mix until a soft dough forms. If the dough seems too crumbly, add milk, 1 teaspoon at a time, until it just comes together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sYRVQPZYIGfAFHasKhE0xH16ZkE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22857-cheese-straws-VAT-step-02-e45c2be2ae614254b6bf8584f25e5e48.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22857/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the dough to a lightly floured surface. Roll out to ½ inch thickness. Cut into 2-inch strips using a knife, pastry wheel, or cookie press with a star tip for a traditional look.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gGM_Lvc28dhWTd2OHR1NROajmrM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22857-cheese-straws-VAT-step-03-ec2c29d36ce2418d990dd7b85478bfa4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22857/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange cheese straws 1 ½ inches apart on the prepared baking sheets; sprinkle with ground red pepper if using.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JVwDfJFBPTbooOPTvjwkgW5rKEA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22857-cheese-straws-VAT-step-04-9113eb061cf944928ef618dbdb257d63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22857/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden and crisp, about 10 to 15 minutes. Cool on the baking sheets for 5 minutes, then transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mTJV2gTZDUf12ZyMbI2s74j04z8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22857-cheese-straws-VAT-step-05-36f377f530cb4e86847a7d634fbc4d0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22857/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
